Z||000002||Gold-86SE||02-17-2001||11:34 PM||||<BR>Nice 84.  Like seeing folks with 84s, seems that not too many people are drawn to them.  To me they set the whole design standard, not saying that Pontiac did not wind up improving the beloved little two-seater.  But, without that 84 model there probably would never have been a Fiero.<P>Again, very nice.  She's a keeper.<P>------------------<BR>84 SE 4.10 4 Speed (Cold and Rain Daily Driver)<BR>85 GT Automatic (Restoration Project)<BR>86 SE 4 Speed (Fair Weather Daily Driver)<BR>87 SC 5 Speed (Not Running, V8 Conversion?)<BR>Please visit my <A HREF="http://www.trifocus.net/~fws/index.html" TARGET=_blank>Fiero Work Shop</A>||||reg||1
